From 8f4bfa4c2013d8fe563349f72b949a4331158c3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:29:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 089/122] 3DSOLID: the history handle of all R2007+ 3DSOLIDs

ACadSharp reads the history handle (H 350) of every R2007+ 3DSOLID; we
wrote it only with SAB (version 2) data, so the SAT 3DSOLIDs of the
R14-R2004 drawings as R2010 lacked it, ACadSharp read past the handles
and lost them ("Index was outside the bounds of the array").

* src/dwg_spec_shared.h (COMMON_3DSOLID): The history_id of all R2007+
3DSOLIDs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/dwg_spec_shared.h | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/dwg_spec_shared.h b/src/dwg_spec_shared.h
index bcf5a32..68a9692 100644
--- a/src/dwg_spec_shared.h
+++ b/src/dwg_spec_shared.h
@@ -587,8 +587,9 @@ free_3dsolid (Dwg_Object *restrict obj, Dwg_Entity_3DSOLID *restrict _obj)
       FIELD_HANDLE (history_id, 4, 350);                                      \
     }                                                                         \
   } else if ((FIELD_VALUE (version) > 1                                       \
-              /* R2013+ 3DSOLID: the SAB is in the AcDs (AutoCAD's R2018) */  \
-              || (dat->version >= R_2013b                                     \
+              /* all R2007+ 3DSOLIDs (ACadSharp), also R2013+ ones with the */\
+              /* SAB in the AcDs (AutoCAD's R2018) */                         \
+              || (dat->version >= R_2007a                                     \
                   && obj->fixedtype == DWG_TYPE__3DSOLID))                    \
              && (!IF_IS_DECODER || AVAIL_BITS (hdl_dat) >= 8)                 \
              /* R2007+ (ACadSharp, AutoCAD's R2004 drawings have none) */     \
-- 
